# Sources of the lessons study (r1/lessons). Documents of the old body already under 2.1 are cited from there; the critic's report is cited as 2.31.

n: 2.10
name: lessons-sources
kind: hub
is: Sources cited by the study of the old body's lessons, read 2026-11-24: the study report, three documents of the old body, and 43 private working notes kept beside it, each note dated by its own front matter or file date. The old body's repository, its entry documents and its seed file are cited from 2.1 to 2.1.7; the critic's report from 2.31.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/lessons

n: 2.10.1
name: lessons.md
kind: source
is: The study report on the lessons of the old body, 385 lines in 8 sections: method and coverage limits, the measured shape of the repository, twelve ranked root causes, a dated table of what the owner asked for, what worked, fifteen collected design decisions, nine open questions, and what stayed uncomfortable.
path: coherence-seed/study/r1/lessons.md
date: 2026-11-24
got: 2026-11-24
at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/lessons

